PROPS=Left: a chunky watering can seen exactly from the side, with its spout on the right: a round-bellied can in clean saturated sky blue, a thick curved carrying handle arching over the top from its back edge to its middle, and a long thick straight spout rising from the lower front of the can up and out to the right at about forty degrees, ending in a plain round open mouth; the can's body is about as tall as the character's head, and can plus spout are about as long as the character's whole arm. Right: a stream of water pouring straight down, as one connected shape: a thick soft ribbon of clear bright light-blue water with a white highlight down its middle, about as long as the character's forearm, narrow and round at its top, gently widening as it falls, and ending at the bottom in a big round water drop with two small round drops joined to it; painted fully opaque in light blue and white.
STAGES=Stage 1: a low rounded mound of freshly dug dark chocolate-brown soil, about as wide as the character's two boots side by side and a third as tall as it is wide, with one plump golden-tan seed half buried in its top. Stage 2: the same mound with a tiny sprout: a short thick pale-green stem curving up out of the top, as tall as the mound, with two small round seed leaves. Stage 3: the same mound with a young plant: a thick green stem about twice as tall as the mound is wide, with two pairs of rounded leaves. Stage 4: the same mound with a tall plant: the thick stem about four times as tall as the mound is wide, with three pairs of big rounded leaves, and at its top one closed fat green flower bud showing a tip of hot pink. Stage 5: the same mound and the same tall plant with the same leaves, and at its top one big open flower facing the viewer: six plain big rounded hot-pink petals around a round golden-yellow centre, the flower as wide as the mound.
CHARACTER=A cheerful young beaver carpenter: warm chestnut-brown fur, a cream muzzle with two big white front teeth showing under a dark-brown nose, small round ears, and a broad flat dark-brown paddle tail. A turquoise knitted long-sleeved sweater with a ribbed collar and ribbed cuffs, mustard-yellow trousers held by a brown belt with a gold buckle, and red boots. Dark-brown mitten paws.
